{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>屯門有工業大廈的法團違反輸入外勞規定，禁止申請一年。</p><p></p><p>勞工處指，南豐工業城業主立案法團在申請「補充勞工優化計劃」期間，提交不實的全職本地僱員數目，即時中止申請，並實施行政制裁，一年內不能再提交申請。</p><p></p><p>勞工處重申，僱主必須嚴格遵守優化計劃的規定，包括優先聘用合適的本地勞工。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T07:41:34.361219+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":136,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T06:33:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T23:18:08.016143+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T07:38:18.986977+00:00","content_hash":"ed807424b3a7a5cefda74548f98c29b5dab28e2d7d9d4bff464cfce2278fcb1f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T07:41:34.361219+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}